{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat's Showdown</strong> is a casual, poker-inspired card battler where two mischievous cat brothers face off in quick, turn-based duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn</strong> \u2014 even if you don\u2019t know poker, the rules click in minutes.<br><strong>Relaxing single-player</strong> \u2014 no timers, no pressure: just you, your cards, and clever cats.<br><strong>Offline PvE</strong> \u2014 perfect for short sessions or play on the go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The twist:</strong> <i>Each win makes the next foe stronger\u2014while you gain a new random buff.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, turn-based battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, approachable rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever-stronger opponents as you win</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new random buff after every win</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, play-at-your-pace experience</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Win 10 Matches","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3813760/2e906892422459902afb0570e03a630fad4ea214.jpg"},{"name":"Win 20 Matches","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3813760/8256548190a2d42441295db8da0eb9951e959792.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3813760?t=1762199939","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3813760?t=1762199939","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813760/5939b95323a2118f41529f2073005adc4a5dd5c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762199939","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813760/5939b95323a2118f41529f2073005adc4a5dd5c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=176219